  "question": {
    "text": "Let <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mtable><mtr><mtd><mi>cos</mi><mi>&#945;</mi></mtd><mtd><mo>-</mo><mi>sin</mi><mi>&#945;</mi></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mi>sin</mi><mi>&#945;</mi></mtd><mtd><mi>cos</mi><mi>&#945;</mi></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mi>R</mi></mrow></mfenced><mi>&#160;</mi></math> such that <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>A</mi><mn>32</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mtable><mtr><mtd><mn>0</mn></mtd><mtd><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>0</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced><mo>.</mo></math> Then, a value of <math><mi>&#945;</mi></math> is:"
  },
